* Ampeg SVT preamp, stage 2 of 4: channel 2 (V2A, Ultra Lo, volume 2, V2B) up to V2B's plate, p2b. It takes the guitar like stage 1 does. Stage 4
* receives p2b through VL2. Channel 2's stack is repeated here as V2B's load (its own copy, with a fitted 130k to ground for the V5 input node
* behind R23: R42 plus the follower's output network); stage 4 has the stack for real, so it loads the V5 input node the way it does in the whole
* circuit. See preamp.net for how the netlist is split.

.nodes x rb rd gin in pkb1 pkb2 pkk1 pkk2 pkk4 jb2 jn2 g2 p2a k2a q2 vt2 wv2 uh2 p2b k2b a2s bb2 w52 d2 t62 w62 b62 tn

V VRAIL x 305.2 430
R R47 x rb 25.02k
C C23 rb 0 13.11u
R RDEC rb rd 12.77k
C CDEC rd 0 14.72u

I VIN gin 1
R RSRC gin in 7k
* The guitar behind its source impedance (see the other amps for the pickup model).
R RPU1 gin pkb1 1e12
.xfmr LPU1 L=2.5
  W pkb1 in 1 pu
.end
R RPU2 gin pkb2 1e12
.xfmr LPU2 L=5
  W pkb2 in 1 pu
.end
C CPU gin in 110p
R RPL gin in 1e12
R SWK1 in pkk1 1e12
C CCAB1 pkk1 0 200p
R SWK2 in pkk2 1e12
C CCAB2 pkk2 0 400p
R SWK4 in pkk4 1e12
C CCAB4 pkk4 0 800p

R SW_N2 in jn2 1e12
R SW_B2 in jb2 1e12
R R13 jn2 g2 47k
R R12 jb2 g2 100k
C C8 jb2 g2 4n7
R R15 g2 0 5.6M

* Channel 2: V2a (220k, 3k3), 0.1u into the Ultra Lo coupling, volume 2 and Ultra Hi, V2b (100k load, 3k3 cathode), 0.1u into the stack.
T V2A g2 p2a k2a 12AX7
R R14 rd p2a 220k
R R16 k2a 0 3k3
C C9 p2a q2 100n
R R19 q2 vt2 10M
C C11 q2 vt2 1n
R SW_UL2 q2 vt2 1e12
R VR_V2T vt2 wv2 1
R VR_V2B wv2 0 1
R SW_UH2 vt2 uh2 1e12
C C12 uh2 wv2 500p
T V2B wv2 p2b k2b 12AX7
R R20 rd p2b 100k
R R21 k2b 0 3k3
C C13 p2b a2s 100n
* Stack 2 (the same as stack 1; its output at the top of the treble pot goes through 100k to V5's input).
R R220B a2s bb2 220k
R VR_BS2T bb2 w52 1
R VR_BS2B w52 d2 1
C C001B bb2 w52 1n
C C01B w52 d2 10n
R R22KB d2 0 22k
C C47PB a2s t62 470p
R VR_TR2T t62 w62 1
R VR_TR2B w62 b62 1
C C47NB b62 0 4n7
R R22 w52 w62 120k
R R23 t62 tn 100k
R RTN tn 0 130k
